<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. soldiers are now fighting alongside Ecuadorian forces against cartels, and MQ-9 Reaper drones have been redeployed from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador. A fishing vessel off Ecuador's coast was attacked, killing multiple people and extending the violence to the maritime domain. Pressure on the Los Choneros cartel is shifting from its leadership to its logistics networks, as indicated by recent analysis. The conflict produced 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPajZUbGM0RmUtdjZzdzRFSmhBQ3dsc3k2bXlwYndqd2FJc2JDZjhBMFE5di1FUFR1NTRRLTZiZzZsM0tsN1BJQ3JzV01LbFdDbWduMnNENDB5QmZkODRzbWVxTWF3cF9ucU5vZmpjbjJULWltMWpIVWxBTzFWRWlxeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNeEFWMGlqekJFZ3lFYm5GeEhnRzdWQ2ZVa2tPS1lob3ZKaXlMS1FMMjRZUmx0aDBNbkdIR1pvTktJZTAwQ0FBdU85VWd6aXRqb0k0ZHZ3UnlubGNJT1lVY1lleU1RNk1FWHJGSlhrcnZFbVhkSXFNdDlmR1RQcHVsbEo3VG9VVVFHTXIwUGhpRGdhTkRxS2FCY192TWhnRy1vNVRMd0h3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Diálogo Americas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOaFRpN1hwTVhNMENSR3NsU25mY3F2a05GRk52Q2NWMGVuaHJFdkM2MjAwa0lZb2ZZM0VlT015UW5KUlRGRi0xelFLTjR1RFlvc0cyV3hYVkJLNlNhRXE1Ml9FQ0YwNG5OX1RZclNpNWZPWDNRZW84ZXYxTmcwbDRXYkIxdW11Mk5tU2hIT0x5ZThDbl82X3RXYW50RjBSS0YyZjJBa01iMGRkYlVHNFJ3OTZpdXJ2RDBnZUlTLVh2WVkxY2ZO?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WATE 6 On Your Side&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQYVl